Tile 1 — DNS Query Time (Top List, host rollup)
timeseries qtime = avg(dt.host.dns.query_time, scalar:true),
  by:{dt.entity.host},
  filter: dt.entity.host in [
    fetch dt.entity.host
    | filter arrayIndexOf(tags, "APMID:APP00005497") != -1
    | fields id
  ]
| fieldsAdd hostname = entityName(dt.entity.host)
| sort qtime desc
| fields hostname, qtime

Tile 2 — Single Query Time by Host (Top List, same metric, per-host granularity)
